msgid ""
"Legacy lf-social-share mu-plugin detected. LF is deferring the base OG set "
"to the mu-plugin and outputting og:locale + og:locale:alternate only. You "
"can deactivate the mu-plugin — LF's built-in Social Share (SEO → Social "
"Share tab) and Open Graph cover the same functionality."
msgstr ""
"Legacy lf-social-share mu-plugin erkannt. LF überträgt das Basis-OG-Set an "
"das mu-plugin und gibt nur og:locale + og:locale:alternate aus. Du kannst "
"das mu-plugin deaktivieren — LF's integrierte Social Share (SEO → Social "
"Share Tab) und Open Graph decken die gleiche Funktionalität ab."

